      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BOOM BOOM JACK (1) returned a better run last time, finishing in the money (31.08) at this track behind Gina Gulla in a Grade 4/5. Has the early speed to land on the pace and can stick on. Ran one of the fastest times on the program last start despite finishing in the minors. One of the contenders. KEELEY ROSE (3) copped a check in the run finishing out of the placings when a 17 length fifth (31.99) in a Invitation at this track. Can measure up this time. PAW OLLIE (5) is having his first look at this track. Missed the frame last time when 4th and beaten 7 lengths (22.86) at Murray Bridge. Comes through a solid form race last start. Has ability and can measure up. JUBILANT (7) with some luck can improve on an unplaced run last time here.",
